    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3016\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"10\" y=\"18\" width=\"40\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">pure</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"47\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">red</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">(255, 0, 0)</text><line x1=\"52.0\" y1=\"35.0\" x2=\"70.0\" y2=\"35.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3016)\"/><rect x=\"72\" y=\"26\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">Y = 76.2</text><rect x=\"124\" y=\"26\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"147\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">Cb = \u221243</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"26\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">Cr = 127.5</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">+128 for 8-bit storage</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"122\" x2=\"226\" y2=\"122\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"40\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">0</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">255</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"76\" width=\"55\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">Y \u2248 76</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"90\" width=\"66\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"111\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">Cb \u2248 85</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"104\" width=\"186\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"113\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">Cr \u2248 255 (clipped)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The bus red (255, 0, 0) becomes Y = 76.2, Cb = \u221243, Cr = 127.5; adding 128 for storage gives Cb \u2248 85 and Cr \u2248 255.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "Plug red into the Rec. 601 rows: <strong>$Y = 0.299\\cdot 255 \\approx 76.2$</strong>, so pure red is fairly dark in luminance.",
      "<strong>$C_b = -0.1687\\cdot255 \\approx -43$</strong> (red has little blue, so Cb is below neutral) and <strong>$C_r = 0.5\\cdot255 = 127.5$</strong> (the maximum red excess).",
      "After the 8-bit +128 offset, Cb \u2248 85 and Cr \u2248 255 (clipped from 255.5), so <strong>red lives at maximum Cr and low Y</strong>."
    ],
    "math": "$$Y=0.299(255)=76.2,\\quad C_b=-0.1687(255)=-43.0,\\quad C_r=0.5(255)=127.5$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The red bus in the recorder.</strong> Its Y value is mid-low, its Cb is low and its Cr is at the ceiling. A bus that is red but dim at night would keep the same Cr-high pattern.",
    "examTrap": "Forgetting the +128 offset makes Cb and Cr look negative. They are stored as unsigned bytes centered at 128.",
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "<b>Example.</b> Convert pure red $(R,G,B)=(255,0,0)$ with the BT.601 matrix: $Y=0.299\\cdot255=76.2$, $C_b=-0.1687\\cdot255=-43.0$, $C_r=0.5\\cdot255=127.5$. With the 8-bit offset $C_b=128-43=85$ and $C_r=128+127.5=255.5$, clipped to $255$.",
    "hint": "Where does the red bus land on the Y, Cb, Cr scales?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$Y=0.299\\cdot255\\approx76.2$ = red is a dark-ish grey.</strong> Only 30% of its weight goes to brightness; most of the pixel's story is in the colour planes.",
      "<strong>$C_b=-0.1687\\cdot255\\approx-43$ = no blue.</strong> Below the neutral 0, so after the offset it is about 85.",
      "<strong>$C_r=0.5\\cdot255=127.5$ = the most red anyone can have.</strong> The top of the scale, so red sits at the maximum of $C_r$ (255 once stored)."
    ],
