    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3021\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"12.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"70.0\" height=\"50.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"47.0\" y=\"17\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">night frame</text><rect x=\"18.0\" y=\"28.0\" width=\"30.0\" height=\"36.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"24.0\" y=\"40.0\" width=\"6.0\" height=\"12.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"36.0\" y=\"40.0\" width=\"6.0\" height=\"12.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><circle cx=\"62.0\" cy=\"46.4\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"48.8\" x2=\"62.0\" y2=\"58.3\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"58.3\" x2=\"58.7\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"62.0\" y1=\"58.3\" x2=\"65.3\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"57.6\" y1=\"52.8\" x2=\"66.4\" y2=\"52.8\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"84.0\" y1=\"46.0\" x2=\"104.0\" y2=\"46.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3021)\"/><line x1=\"112.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"230.0\" y2=\"100.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3021)\"/><line x1=\"112.0\" y1=\"100.0\" x2=\"112.0\" y2=\"22.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3021)\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">r\u2096</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#000000\">n\u2096</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"70.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"129.0\" y=\"38.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"62.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"60.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"151.0\" y=\"78.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"22.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"162.0\" y=\"90.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"10.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"173.0\" y=\"94.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"6.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"184.0\" y=\"96.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"4.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"195.0\" y=\"92.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"8.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"206.0\" y=\"86.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"14.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"217.0\" y=\"92.0\" width=\"9\" height=\"8.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">dark: mass at left</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">p(r\u2096) = n\u2096/MN</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">\u03a3 p(r\u2096) = 1</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">same pixels in any order \u21d2 same histogram</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">(the position of everything is lost)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "A dark night frame and its histogram: n\u2096 pixels at each grey level r\u2096, p(r\u2096) = n\u2096/MN, all the bars adding to 1. Shuffling the pixels leaves the bars unchanged.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "The <strong>histogram</strong> counts how many pixels have each gray level, $h(r_k)=n_k$; dividing by $MN$ gives the probability $p(r_k)=n_k/MN$.",
      "Its <strong>shape reveals exposure and contrast</strong>: mass at left means dark, at right means bright, a narrow bump means low contrast, two bumps suggest object plus background.",
      "It <strong>discards all spatial information</strong>: every rearrangement of the same pixels gives the same histogram."
    ],
    "math": "$$p(r_k)=\\frac{n_k}{MN},\\qquad \\sum_{k=0}^{L-1}p(r_k)=1$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>A night frame piles up on the left.</strong> The street at night is mostly dark, so the bars crowd near black with a small bump for the lamps. The tally says nothing about where the lamp or the person is.",
    "examTrap": "Two completely different images can share one histogram. Never use the histogram alone to claim two images are the same.",
    "stmtKind": "DEFINITION",
    "statement": "<b>Image histogram.</b> For a digital image of size $M\\times N$ with gray levels $r_0,\\dots,r_{L-1}$, the histogram is $h(r_k)=n_k$, the number of pixels with level $r_k$, and the normalized histogram $p(r_k)=n_k/MN$ estimates the probability of level $r_k$, with $\\sum_{k=0}^{L-1}p(r_k)=1$. The histogram carries no spatial information.",
    "hint": "If you shuffle every pixel of the night frame, which picture of it does not change?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$n_k$ = how many pixels have grey level $r_k$.</strong> One bar of the tally per level, from black to white.",
      "<strong>$p(r_k)=n_k/MN$ = the share of the frame at that level.</strong> Dividing by the total pixel count turns counts into probabilities.",
      "<strong>$\\sum p(r_k)=1$ = nothing is left out.</strong> Every pixel is in exactly one bar, so the shares add to one."
    ],
    "textbookImg": null,
