    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3035\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"14.0\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"28.0\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"42.0\" y=\"18.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"14.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"28.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"42.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"14.0\" y=\"46.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"28.0\" y=\"46.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"42.0\" y=\"46.0\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"35\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">N\u2084: 3 objects</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"83\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">N\u2088: 1 object</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">N\u2084(p)</text><rect x=\"112.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"124.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"136.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"112.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"124.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#7b8494\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"136.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"112.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"124.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"136.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">N\u2088(p)</text><rect x=\"174.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"186.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"198.0\" y=\"20.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"174.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"186.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#7b8494\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"198.0\" y=\"32.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"174.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"186.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><rect x=\"198.0\" y=\"44.0\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#b8c0cc\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">share an edge</text><text x=\"192\" y=\"66\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">also diagonals</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">pass 1: smallest neighbour label, note equal pairs</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">pass 2: union\u2013find, relabel</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">object 8-connected \u21d2 background 4-connected</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Three diagonal pixels are three objects under N\u2084 but one under N\u2088. Labelling scans twice: first guess labels, then merge equal ones.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>4-connected</strong> neighbors share an edge; <strong>8-connected</strong> neighbors also include diagonals. The choice changes what counts as 'one object'.",
      "<strong>Two-pass labeling:</strong> scan, give each pixel the smallest neighboring label (or a new one), note equivalent labels, then <strong>resolve with union\u2013find</strong> and relabel.",
      "Use <strong>8-connectivity for the foreground and 4 for the background</strong> (or vice versa) to avoid the connectivity paradox where a closed curve fails to enclose a region."
    ],
    "math": "$$N_4(p)=\\{(x\\pm1,y),(x,y\\pm1)\\},\\qquad N_8(p)=N_4(p)\\cup\\{(x\\pm1,y\\pm1)\\}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Counting people in the frame.</strong> After cleaning the mask, give each separate white blob its own number: that is the head count. Whether two blobs meeting at a corner count as one depends on 4 or 8.",
    "examTrap": "Using 8-connectivity for BOTH object and background creates the paradox (a ring that is both connected and encloses nothing). Pair 8 with 4.",
    "stmtKind": "ALGORITHM",
    "statement": "<b>Connectivity and two-pass connected-component labelling.</b> The 4-neighbours of $p=(x,y)$ are $N_4(p)=\\{(x\\pm1,y),(x,y\\pm1)\\}$ and the 8-neighbours $N_8(p)=N_4(p)\\cup\\{(x\\pm1,y\\pm1)\\}$. Pass 1: scan row by row, give each foreground pixel the smallest label among its already-labelled neighbours (or a new label) and record the labels found equal. Pass 2: resolve the equivalences (union\u2013find) and replace each label by its class representative. Use 8-connectivity for the foreground with 4-connectivity for the background (or the reverse).",
    "hint": "Do two pixels touching only at a corner belong to the same person?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>$N_4(p)$ = the four neighbours that share an edge.</strong> Diagonal pixels do not count as touching.",
      "<strong>$N_8(p)$ = also the four diagonals.</strong> Two corner-touching pixels now count as one blob.",
      "<strong>Two passes with union\u2013find = a name for every blob.</strong> The first pass may give one blob two labels; the second merges them. Pair 8-connected objects with a 4-connected background to avoid the closed-curve paradox."
    ],
