    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3056\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"10\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">f</text><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"39.0\" y=\"17.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1</text><rect x=\"48.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"57.0\" y=\"17.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">2</text><rect x=\"66.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"17.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">3</text><rect x=\"84.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"93.0\" y=\"17.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">4</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">flip h</text><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"39.0\" y=\"41.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-1</text><rect x=\"48.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"57.0\" y=\"41.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">0</text><rect x=\"66.0\" y=\"30.0\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"75.0\" y=\"41.5\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">slide it along f, add the products</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">n = 2:  3\u00b71 + 1\u00b7(\u22121) = 2</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">f \u2217 h</text><rect x=\"30.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"41.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">1</text><rect x=\"52.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"63.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">2</text><rect x=\"74.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"85.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">2</text><rect x=\"96.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"107.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">2</text><rect x=\"118.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"129.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-3</text><rect x=\"140.0\" y=\"70.0\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"151.0\" y=\"83.5\" font-size=\"9\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-4</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">end</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"6\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\"></text><text x=\"120\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">length = M + K \u2212 1 = 4 + 3 \u2212 1 = 6</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">middle value 2 = slope of the ramp; ends = zero-padding</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">correlation would give \u22122 inside</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "The four pixels f = [1, 2, 3, 4] with the flipped kernel [\u22121, 0, 1] slid along them give [1, 2, 2, 2, \u22123, \u22124]: a steady 2 inside and zero-padding values at the ends.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Flip</strong> $h=[1,0,-1]$ to $[-1,0,1]$, then slide it along $f=[1,2,3,4]$ computing the full overlap at every shift.",
      "<strong>Results:</strong> $n=0:1$; $n=1:2$; $n=2:3-1=2$; $n=3:4-2=2$; $n=4:-3$; $n=5:-4$, giving <strong>[1, 2, 2, 2, \u22123, \u22124]</strong>.",
      "The middle value <strong>2</strong> is the discrete derivative (here $(f_{x+1}-f_{x-1})$) of a unit-slope ramp; the end values are <strong>zero-padding artifacts</strong>."
    ],
    "math": "$$f\\ast h=[1,\\,2,\\,2,\\,2,\\,-3,\\,-4],\\qquad \\text{length}=M+K-1=4+3-1=6$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>A strip of four pixels across the kerb.</strong> The brightness rises 1, 2, 3, 4. The derivative kernel reports a steady slope of 2 inside and false jumps at the ends of the strip.",
    "examTrap": "With correlation (no flip) you would get the NEGATIVE of the interior result (\u22122). Always confirm which operation is meant before reading an edge sign.",
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "<b>Example.</b> Let $f=[1,2,3,4]$ and $h=[1,0,-1]$. The full convolution has length $M+K-1=6$: $f\\ast h=[1,\\,2,\\,2,\\,2,\\,-3,\\,-4]$. Interior values equal $f(n)-f(n-2)$, the discrete derivative of the ramp; the end values come from zero-padding. Correlation gives the negative of the interior values.",
    "hint": "Which entries of f \u2217 h are real slope, and which come from running off the ends?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>Flip $h$ to $[-1,0,1]$.</strong> Convolution turns the kernel round before sliding it along $f=[1,2,3,4]$.",
      "<strong>$n=2:\\ 3-1=2$, $n=3:\\ 4-2=2$ = the slope of the ramp.</strong> Each interior value is a difference of two pixels, which for a unit ramp is 2.",
      "<strong>Length $4+3-1=6$ and ends $1,2,-3,-4$ = zero-padding.</strong> At the ends the kernel hangs off the data, so those entries are not real slope."
    ],
