      "<strong>$\\angle F$ = where the stripes line up.</strong> Edges are places where many waves line up at once, so phase carries the street's shapes and positions.",
      "<strong>$\\mathcal F^{-1}\\{e^{j\\angle F}\\}$ = phase only.</strong> Setting every magnitude to 1 and transforming back still shows the outline of the scene."
