    "cardNumber": "04",
    "category": "2-D DWT",
    "highlighterClass": "highlight-purple",
    "title": "2-D DWT Subbands (Pyramid)",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3094\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"20\" y=\"12\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"108\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"20\" y=\"12\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><line x1=\"44\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"44\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"68\" y2=\"36\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.6\"/><text x=\"32\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">LL\u2082</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HL\u2082</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">LH\u2082</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HH\u2082</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HL\u2081</text><text x=\"44\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">LH\u2081</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HH\u2081</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">LL = thumbnail</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HL = vertical edges</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">LH = horizontal edges</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">HH = diagonals</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">recurse on LL only</text><text x=\"176\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">size(LL\u2c7c) = M/2\u1d36 \u00d7 N/2\u1d36</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"132\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">total coefficients = MN: critically sampled</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Level 1 splits the frame into LL, HL, LH, HH; level 2 splits only LL again, giving LL\u2082, HL\u2082, LH\u2082, HH\u2082. The thumbnail LL\u2c7c is M/2\u1d36 \u00d7 N/2\u1d36.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "A 2D DWT applies the 1D filter bank <strong>along rows, then along columns</strong>, giving four quarter-size subbands: LL (low-low), HL, LH, HH.",
      "<strong>LL</strong> is a half-resolution thumbnail; <strong>HL</strong> responds to vertical edges, <strong>LH</strong> to horizontal edges, <strong>HH</strong> to diagonal detail.",
      "Recurse on the <strong>LL band only</strong> to get a pyramid. Most coefficients in detail bands are tiny, so compression keeps the few big ones (JPEG 2000)."
    ],
    "math": "$$\\text{levels}=J:\\quad \\text{size}(LL_J)=\\tfrac{M}{2^J}\\times\\tfrac{N}{2^J},\\qquad \\#\\text{coeffs}=MN\\ \\ (\\text{critically sampled})$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>The street frame as a pyramid.</strong> The thumbnail sits in the corner and the building's horizontal window ledges, vertical poles and diagonal wires fall into three different detail bands.",
    "examTrap": "Naming differs between books: HL may mean 'high-pass horizontally' or 'vertically'. Check which axis the first letter refers to.",
    "stmtKind": "ALGORITHM",
    "statement": "<b>2D discrete wavelet transform (pyramid).</b> Apply the 1D analysis filter bank along the rows and then along the columns of an $M\\times N$ image. This gives four subbands of size $\\frac M2\\times\\frac N2$: $LL$ (low-low), $HL$, $LH$ and $HH$. Repeat on the $LL$ band for $J$ levels; $LL_J$ has size $\\frac M{2^J}\\times\\frac N{2^J}$, and the total number of coefficients stays $MN$ (critical sampling).",
    "hint": "Which subband of the street frame holds the thumbnail, and which holds the horizontal edges?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>LL = low-pass both ways.</strong> A half-size thumbnail of the frame, which is split again at the next level.",
      "<strong>HL, LH = one high-pass, one low-pass.</strong> They respond to edges in one direction each: vertical edges in HL and horizontal edges in LH, in the usual naming.",
      "<strong>HH = high-pass both ways.</strong> Diagonal detail and noise. Only $LL$ is split again, so the result is a pyramid whose detail bands are mostly tiny numbers."
    ],
