    "title": "Worked Benchmark: 3-Level Haar of [4, 6, 10, 12]",
    "drawingSvg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 240 145\" class=\"w-full h-full\"><defs><marker id=\"arr-3096\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M 0 1.5 L 8 5 L 0 8.5 z\" fill=\"#000000\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"10\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">street row</text><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"82.5\" y=\"21.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">4</text><rect x=\"95.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"107.5\" y=\"21.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">6</text><rect x=\"120.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"132.5\" y=\"21.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">10</text><rect x=\"145.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"157.5\" y=\"21.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">12</text><line x1=\"120.0\" y1=\"34.0\" x2=\"120.0\" y2=\"44.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3096)\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">pairs: average, half-difference</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">level 1</text><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"82.5\" y=\"63.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">5</text><rect x=\"95.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"107.5\" y=\"63.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">11</text><rect x=\"120.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"132.5\" y=\"63.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-1</text><rect x=\"145.0\" y=\"48.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"157.5\" y=\"63.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-1</text><line x1=\"95.0\" y1=\"76.0\" x2=\"95.0\" y2=\"86.0\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"1\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-3096)\"/><text x=\"103\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"6.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">again on the averages</text><text x=\"10\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#000000\">level 2</text><rect x=\"70.0\" y=\"90.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"82.5\" y=\"105.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">8</text><rect x=\"95.0\" y=\"90.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"107.5\" y=\"105.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-3</text><rect x=\"120.0\" y=\"90.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"132.5\" y=\"105.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-1</text><rect x=\"145.0\" y=\"90.0\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d9dee7\" stroke=\"#000000\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"157.5\" y=\"105.0\" font-size=\"8\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">-1</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">rebuild: 5 = 8 + (\u22123) , 11 = 8 \u2212 (\u22123)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"7\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-style=\"normal\" font-weight=\"normal\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#000000\">4 = 5 + (\u22121) , 6 = 5 \u2212 (\u22121) , 10 = 11 + (\u22121) , 12 = 11 \u2212 (\u22121)</text></svg>",
    "drawingCaption": "Four pixels [4, 6, 10, 12] become [5, 11 | \u22121, \u22121] and then [8 | \u22123 | \u22121, \u22121]. Averages go on to the next level; details stay.",
    "coreTranslation": [
      "<strong>Level 1:</strong> pair up $(4,6)\\to$ avg 5, detail $(4-6)/2=-1$; $(10,12)\\to$ avg 11, detail $-1$. Result: <strong>[5, 11 | \u22121, \u22121]</strong>.",
      "<strong>Level 2</strong> on the averages $(5,11)$: avg <strong>8</strong>, detail <strong>\u22123</strong>, giving the pyramid <strong>[8 | \u22123 | \u22121, \u22121]</strong>.",
      "<strong>Rebuild</strong> bottom-up: $5=8+(-3)$, $11=8-(-3)$, then $4=5+(-1)$, $6=5-(-1)$, $10=11+(-1)$, $12=11-(-1)$. Perfect reconstruction, and the tiny details compress well."
    ],
    "math": "$$[4,6,10,12]\\ \\to\\ [8,\\,-3,\\,-1,\\,-1],\\qquad \\text{(unnormalized Haar: avg/diff by 2)}$$",
    "personalConnection": "<strong>Four pixels across the kerb.</strong> The 8 is the overall brightness, the \u22123 says the second half is brighter, and the two \u22121s say each pair rises slightly: the same numbers rebuilt exactly. ",
    "examTrap": "With the orthonormal Haar the filters carry 1/\u221a2 instead, so the numbers differ by \u221a2 factors. Match the convention in the question.",
    "stmtKind": "WORKED EXAMPLE",
    "statement": "<b>Example.</b> Unnormalized Haar transform (average and half-difference) of $x=[4,6,10,12]$. Level 1: $(4,6)\\to(5,-1)$, $(10,12)\\to(11,-1)$, giving $[5,11\\mid-1,-1]$. Level 2 on the averages $(5,11)\\to(8,-3)$, giving $[8\\mid-3\\mid-1,-1]$. Reconstruction: $5=8+(-3)$, $11=8-(-3)$, then $4=5+(-1)$, $6=5-(-1)$, $10=11+(-1)$, $12=11-(-1)$.",
    "hint": "After two levels of pairing, which numbers are the thumbnail and which are the details?",
    "breakdown": [
      "<strong>Level 1: $(4,6)\\to5,\\,-1$ and $(10,12)\\to11,\\,-1$.</strong> The average of each pair and half their difference: $[5,11\\mid-1,-1]$.",
      "<strong>Level 2 on $(5,11)$: average $8$, detail $-3$.</strong> The averages are split again, and the pyramid is $[8\\mid-3\\mid-1,-1]$.",
      "<strong>Rebuild: sum and difference back.</strong> $5=8+(-3)$, $11=8-(-3)$, then each pair from its average and detail: perfect reconstruction, and the small details compress well."
    ],
